  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Migration Governance Programme (RMGP) 2024-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the RMGP is that migration management is enhanced, safe, orderly and rights-based in focus and transit countries in the Mediterranean region. 

While the RMGP will support activities across the region, it will initially also focus on enhancing support to activities in Egypt and Tunisia with a specific focus on more safe and orderly migration governance and management. 

For now, the main implementing partners will be IOM, UNHCR, ICMPD, EUAA and DIHR, which may also support national authorities, entities and organisations in each country.</narrative>
  </description>
